      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `embed_for_search.py` that embeds a query and documents for semantic search using a concrete external provider, I need to select a provider that offers a semantic search API. One such provider is Amazon Bedrock, which offers a service for generating embeddings. I will use the Amazon Bedrock service to identify the provider in the code. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
